This license covers ScoreHalo's own source only.

ScoreHalo does not bundle, vendor, or link homr. It invokes homr as a separate
 process, so homr remains under its own AGPL-3.0 license and is neither
relicensed nor distributed as part of this project. If homr's code or model
weights are ever added to this repository, that boundary no longer holds and
this project as a whole must comply with AGPL-3.0 instead. Keep homr installed
separately (`homr --init`) and keep its license text intact.
